@startuml
[*] --> CreateUser : entry / nil
CreateUser : do / Create account
CreateUser : exit / Login

Login : entry / nil
Login : do / Login
Login : exit / Dashboard

Dashboard : entry / Login
Dashboard : do / Display dashboard
Dashboard : exit / ApplyForVisa : Apply for visa button clicked
Dashboard : exit / ViewStatus : View status button clicked
Dashboard : exit / Settings : Settings button clicked

ApplyForVisa : entry / Dashboard
ApplyForVisa : do / Fill application form
ApplyForVisa : exit / PaymentConfirmation : Submit and proceed to payment

PaymentConfirmation : entry / ApplyForVisa
PaymentConfirmation : do / Make payment
PaymentConfirmation : exit / Accepted : Payment accepted, application submitted

Accepted : entry / ViewStatus
Accepted : do / Display status page

ViewStatus : entry / Accepted
ViewStatus : do / Check visa status
ViewStatus : exit / CancelApplication : Cancel application button clicked
ViewStatus : exit / GiveFeedback : Give feedback button clicked

Settings : entry / Dashboard
Settings : do / Edit user details
Settings : exit / Dashboard

CancelApplication : entry / ViewStatus
CancelApplication : do / Cancel application
CancelApplication : exit / Dashboard

GiveFeedback : entry / ViewStatus
GiveFeedback : do / Give feedback
GiveFeedback : exit / Dashboard

Logout : entry / Dashboard
Logout : do / Log out
Logout : exit / Login
@enduml
